Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáp thang máy đứt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.31,0:00:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,ở tầng tám mươi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,lăm — nhảy lên
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,thì sống không?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.53,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhiều người nghĩ nhảy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,lên đúng lúc sẽ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,cứu mình. Sai rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nhảy giỏi nhất cũng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,chỉ trừ được bốn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,mét mỗi giây.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Rơi từ tầng hai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,mươi, thang chạm đất
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,hơn một trăm cây
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.71,0:00:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,số một giờ. Nhưng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,thang máy có tới
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,bốn lớp an toàn,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,phanh kẹp chặt mỗi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.91,0:00:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,khi quá tốc độ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nếu thang thật sự
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,rơi, cách khoa học
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,nhất là nằm dài
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,xuống sàn, tay ôm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,đầu. Lực va chạm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.89,0:00:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,trải đều khắp cơ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,thể — không chắc
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,sống, nhưng là cơ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,hội tốt nhất.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thang máy an toàn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,hơn bạn nghĩ. Bạn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,có dám đi thang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,tầng tám mươi lăm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.49,0:00:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,không? Bình luận nhé!
